## Compilation and Usage

### Standard Compilation (with CSFML)
```bash
make                    # Build the project
./my_radar script.rdr   # Run simulation with script file
./my_radar -h           # Display help information
```

### Mock Version (without CSFML)
```bash
make -f Makefile.mock   # Build mock version
./my_radar script.rdr   # Run text-based simulation
```

### Testing
```bash
make tests_run          # Run complete test suite
```

